      "description": "§7.1 promises the AI summary is ready before the patient reaches the consultation room, and §8.5 says that promise is measured rather than asserted. This is the measurement. The gauge is absent rather than zero when nothing finished, so a quiet night does not fire this — which is why the condition is a floor on attainment rather than a ceiling on misses.",
